      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report a case of thrombotic thrombocytopenic purpura presenting as a sudden headache with associated neurologic deficits. The diagnosis of this rare disorder is discussed, with special attention given to a potential pitfall in evaluation and treatment--platelet transfusion."},
